+        SUBTTL  Vector save/restore & default Zero divide routines
+        PAGE
+;[]------------------------------------------------------------[]
+;|                                                              |
+;| Interrupt Save/Restore routines and default divide by zero   |
+;| handler.                                                     |
+;|                                                              |
+;[]------------------------------------------------------------[]
+
+ZeroDivision    PROC    FAR
+                mov     cx, lgth_ZeroDivMSG
+                mov     dx, offset DGROUP: ZeroDivMSG
+                jmp     MsgExit3
+ZeroDivision    ENDP
