+
+/******************************************************************************/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                                DOSCLASS.HPP                                */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*     A pure virtual base class for file access and derived classes for      */
+/*                    handle and stream based file access                     */
+/*                                                                            */
+/*============================================================================*/
+/*                                                                            */
+/*                       Written by Scott Dale Robison                        */
+/*                                                                            */
