+    /*     ConfType = 3 = Usenet Moderated Newsgroup                      */
+    /*                    (Import Normally /                              */
+    /*                     Export Public Messages as Email to Moderator / */
+    /*                     Export Private Messages as Email to TO:)       */
+    /*     ConfType = 4 = Usenet Public Newsgroup                         */
+    /*                    (Import Normally /                              */
+    /*                     Export Public Messages as Articles /           */
+    /*                     Export Private Messages as Email to TO:)       */
+    /*                                                                    */
+    /**********************************************************************/
